"spreminjanje ključnih delov vašega sistema."

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:1
msgid "Lightweight user configuration"
msgstr "Enostavna nastavitev uporabnikov."

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:2
msgid ""
"Mugshot enables users to easily update personal contact information. With "
"Mugshot, users are able to:"
msgstr ""
"Mugshot omogoča uporabnikom enostavno posodabljanje osebnih kontaktnih "
"podatkov. Z Mugshotom lahko uporabniki:"

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:3
msgid ""
"Set the account photo displayed at login and optionally synchronize this "
"photo with their Pidgin buddy icon"
msgstr ""
"Nastavijo fotografijo računa, ki se prikaže ob prijavi, in po želji to "
"fotografijo sinhronizirajo s programom Pidgin"

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:4
msgid ""
"Set account details stored in /etc/passwd (usable with the finger command) "
"and optionally synchronize with their LibreOffice contact information"
msgstr ""
"Nastavijo podatke o računu, shranjene v datoteki /etc/passwd (ki jih je "
"mogoče uporabiti z ukazom finger), ter po želji sinhronizirajo te podatke s "
"svojimi kontaktnimi podatki v LibreOffice"

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:5
msgid ""
"Mugshot has moved to GitHub! This maintenance release includes numerous "
"translation updates."
msgstr ""
"Mugshot se je preselil na GitHub! Ta vzdrževalna različica vključuje "
"številne posodobitve prevodov."

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:6
msgid ""
"This release includes a number of code quality improvements, bug fixes, and "
"translations. Mugshot can now be built and run in a minimal chroot "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Ta izdaja vključuje številne izboljšave kakovosti kode, popravke napak in "
"prevode. Mugshot je zdaj mogoče zgraditi in zagnati v minimalnem okolju "
"chroot."

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:7
msgid ""
"This stable release adds support for the latest GTK and GStreamer "
"technologies."
msgstr ""
"Ta stabilna različica dodaja podporo za najnovejše tehnologije GTK in "
"GStreamer."

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:8
msgid ""
"This development release restores camera dialog functionality that with "
"recent software versions."
msgstr ""
"Ta razvojna različica vrača funkcionalnost pogovornega okna kamere, ki je "
"bila v zadnjih različicah programske opreme izgubljena."

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:9
msgid ""
"This development release fixes a large number of bugs from previous "
"releases. User properties that cannot be edited are now restricted to "
"administrative users."
msgstr ""
"Ta razvojna različica odpravlja številne napake iz prejšnjih različic. "
"Lastnosti uporabnikov, ki jih ni mogoče urejati, so zdaj omejene na "
"skrbniške uporabnike."

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:10
msgid ""
"This development release upgrades the camera dialog to use Cheese and "
"Clutter to display and capture the camera feed."
msgstr ""
"Ta razvojna različica nadgrajuje dialog kamere, tako da za prikaz in zajem "
"slike s kamere uporablja programe Cheese in Clutter."

#: ../data/metainfo/mugshot.appdata.xml.in.h:11
msgid ""
"This stable release improves Mugshot functionality for LDAP users, and "
"includes the latest SudoDialog, improving the appearance and usability of "
"the password dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ta stabilna različica izboljšuje delovanje programa Mugshot za uporabnike "
"LDAP in vključuje najnovejšo različico SudoDialog, ki izboljšuje videz in "
"uporabnost okna za vnos gesla."
